<title>FRANCE: TENNIS-FRENCH OPEN WOMEN'S SINGLES RESULTS-DAY SEVEN.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-FRENCH OPEN WOMEN'S SINGLES RESULTS-DAY SEVEN.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-06-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Women's singles results on the seventh day of the French Open tennis tournament on Sunday.</p>
<p>Prefix number denotes seeding.</p>
<p>Fourth round:</p>
<p>1-Martina Hingis (Switzerland) beat 16-Barbara Paulus (Austria) 6-3 0-6 6-0</p>
<p>2-Steffi Graf (Germany) beat 13-Irina Spirlea (Romania) 6-7 (4-7) 6-2 6-2</p>
<p>3-Monica Seles (U.S.) beat 10-Mary Pierce (France) 6-4 7-5</p>
<p>9-Iva Majoli (Croatia) beat 5-Lindsay Davenport (U.S.) 5-7 6-4 6-2</p>
<p>6-Arantxa Sanchez-Vicario (Spain) beat Natasha Zvereva (Belarus) 6-4 6-2</p>
<p>11-Amanda Coetzer (South Africa) beat 7-Conchita Martinez (Spain) 6-7 (4-7) 6-4 6-3</p>
<p>12-Mary Joe Fernandez (U.S.) beat Lisa Raymond (U.S.) 6-7 (4-7) 6-2 6-2</p>
<p>Ruxandra Dragomir (Romania) beat Nicole Arendt (U.S.) 6-1 6-1</p>
<p>(Ends women results)</p>
</text>
